                                "sense_id": "bb4b92c9-aeb2-39a9-bb5d-87127f22e444",
                                "text": "These data suggest a possible differential local sensitivity of salpingian and uterine endometrium for the test chemicals or excessive hormonal effects of induced pituitary tumors."
